  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The table shows how the count rate from a sample of a radioactive nuclide varies with time t. The nuclide has a half-life of 50 s. The average background count rate is constant.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What count rate will the detector measure when t = 150 s?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">8 s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">16 s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">24 s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">32 s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
